This plugin is a fork of the `omarchy.clock` bar widget from Omarchy
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), which is distributed under the MIT
License and is copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson. The original notice
and permission for that work are reproduced below, as the MIT License
requires of any substantial portion of the original software that this
plugin is derived from.

Changes made in this fork are listed in CHANGELOG.md and include, among
others: persistent reminders implemented with a user systemd timer instead
of transient timers; day tasks attached to calendar days; a due-time field;
a reminder option for the day of the due date itself; a red/green task
colour scheme; and per-task descriptions. This fork is not endorsed by
Omarchy.

